    (v_topic_id, 'Approximate (v, adj)', '/əˈprɒksɪmət/', 'ước tính, khoảng chừng - xấp xỉ, gần đúng', 'to calculate something in a way that is not exact - not exact, but close to an exact amount, number, time, etc', 'Topic Vocabulary', 1, 28),
