    (v_topic_id, 'break down', NULL, 'chia thành từng phần - quá trình chia cái gì thành từng phần', 'divide something such as a total amount into separate parts breakdown (n) the process of a substance breaking into the parts of which it is made', 'Phrasal Verbs', 2, 35),
    (v_topic_id, 'build up', NULL, 'tăng lên, phát triển lên - nói về điều gì tích cực', 'increase or make something increase; gradually develop; talk about someone or something in a very positive way so that people are impressed with them; make someone bigger, healthier and stronger, especially by making them eat more build-up (n)', 'Phrasal Verbs', 2, 36),
